OL,3,GNEWSAHospital opens new #41.5m cancer
OL,4,Aand surgery centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new #41.5m cancer and surgery centre
OL,7,Fhas opened in Surrey which a hospital
OL,8,Fsays will help it perform about 7,000
OL,9,Fmore operations a year.
OL,11,FThe Royal Surrey County Hospital in
OL,12,FGuildford said its Cancer and Surgical
OL,13,FInnovation Centre included six
OL,14,Foperating theatres, a short stay ward
OL,15,Fand specialist facilities.
OL,17,FA spokesperson for the Royal Surrey NHS
OL,18,FFoundation Trust, which runs the
OL,19,Fhospital, said the centre would first
OL,20,Fopen with three theatres and other
OL,21,Ffacilities, with a full opening
OL,22,Fexpected in early 2027.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
