OL,3,GNEWSAHospital opens new #41.5m cancer
OL,4,Aand surgery centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FLouise Stead, the trust's chief
OL,7,Fexecutive, said: "The impact of this
OL,8,Fcentre will be felt by tens of
OL,9,Fthousands of patients for years to
OL,10,Fcome."
